WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/system/components/chatbot/ChatMessageItem.tsx — a single chat row, a PURE presentational
  leaf fed a `message` prop + grouping/position flags + onRegenerate/onEditAndResend callbacks by the Chatbot
  page. Its only hook is useTranslation. Render branches reproduced verbatim:
    • role split          : isUser → cyan bubble, right, user avatar ; assistant → surface bubble, left, bot avatar
    • avatar grouping     : shown when isFirstInGroup, else reserved-but-invisible (consecutive same-role rows)
    • editing             : Textarea + Cancel(X) + "Save & resend"(Check, disabled when empty/unchanged)
    • user content        : plain whitespace-pre-wrap text
    • assistant content   : MarkdownRenderer + a blinking streaming cursor when isStreaming
    • timestamp           : shown when isLastInGroup && !isStreaming → formatTime(created_at)
    • actions (hover)     : Copy always · Regenerate (assistant && isLastAssistant && onRegenerate)
                            · Edit (user && isLastUser && onEditAndResend) ; suppressed while streaming/editing/disabled
    • submitEdit          : trim draft; cancel when empty or unchanged; else onEditAndResend(message, trimmed)
    • keyboard            : Enter submits, Shift+Enter newline, Escape cancels

