PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  GlassPanel/bubble       → RoundedRectangle(TSRadius.lg) + tokenised fill/stroke (ChatBubbleStyle)
  user bubble cyan-500/10,/20  → Color.TS.accent.opacity(0.10) fill / 0.22 stroke (the cyan the brand accent maps to)
  assistant --surface-2/--border-subtle → Color.TS.surface / Color.TS.border
  Avatar kind=bot|user    → ChatAvatar: SF Symbol "sparkles"|"person.fill" in a 28×28 rounded chip, tinted
  lucide RotateCw/Pencil/X/Check → SF Symbols arrow.clockwise / pencil / xmark / checkmark
  purple-300 stream cursor → Color.TS.chartSeriesPower.opacity(0.8), pulsing, Reduce-Motion-static
  Button/CopyButton/Textarea (@/components/ui) → TSButton / TSCopyButton / TSTextArea (shared P4 library)
  typography              → Font.TS.body/bodySm/caption ; text colors via Color.TS.textPrimary/Secondary/Muted
  i18n                    → ChatStrings.string(key, web-default); ZERO English literals in code paths
  a11y                    → avatar labels; one combined VoiceOver element per message (role: text, time);
                            every interactive control (.accessibilityLabel) ; edit field identifier
  telemetry               → view.opened surface="ChatMessageItem" (P1/S11), default OSLog sink, emitted once
  keyboard                → Escape cancels (.onKeyPress); Enter→Save button (the multi-line editor reserves
                            Return for newlines — the platform-idiomatic submit affordance; documented in-source)

STATES (every state renders — no hidden surface)
  loading   → typing-indicator bubble (web parent isLoading + a streaming reply before its first token)
  empty     → friendly empty-state bubble for a resolved message with no content (never a blank box)
  error     → error bubble + Retry (web QueryError peer) wired to model.refresh()
  data      → full bubble: user text / assistant markdown (+ cursor) + timestamp + action row + inline editor
  stale     → "Reconnecting — this reply may be stale" banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale edge
  offline   → "Offline — showing the last known message" banner (cached value, no auto-refresh)

